					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891103,
					"content": "食材也就位了，準備好廚具，馬上就能開工。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891104,
					"content": "妳好呀，愛可菲！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891105,
					"content": "哦？我的雇主們來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891106,
					"content": "#刺玫會的老闆，加上著名的{NICKNAME}和派蒙…這樣的陣容營運一個映影樂園，有點奢華。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891107,
					"content": "德波大飯店的前主廚才和「奢華」這個詞關聯最緊密吧？不管妳走到哪，都會帶來一股精緻料理的香氣哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891108,
					"content": "咳咳…正事要緊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891109,
					"content": "#看來，娜維婭是想讓{NICKNAME}決定各個時期的「主題料理」吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891110,
					"content": "「主題料理」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401891111,
					"content": "這就是我之前提到的經營策略——用頂級廚師的料理，為「海薇瑪映影歡樂城」吸引額外的客源！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891112,
					"content": "不…不只吸引客源，愛可菲的傑作肯定還能發揮其他驚喜的效果！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891113,
					"content": "妳想想，派蒙，假如只需要一張樂園的門票，不僅能玩個痛快，還能吃到傳說中的美食，妳不心動嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891114,
					"content": "那那那！那我一定天天來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891115,
						401891116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891115,
					"content": "有沒有年卡？年卡救一下？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401891117,
					"content": "不過，要是公開菜單，吸引客人的效果就會減半了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891118,
					"content": "根據一位美食品牌顧問的調查，許多餐館採用了「主廚隨機料理」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891119,
					"content": "#所以，每過幾個經營週期，就由{F#妳}{M#你}給我靈感，決定我應該製作什麼「主題料理」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891120,
					"content": "把手給我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891121,
						401891122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891121,
					"content": "手…手嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401891123,
					"content": "嗯，溫暖而飽含活力的觸感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891124,
					"content": "#長期接觸劍柄的肌膚結有一層堅韌的繭，但很細膩，{F#妳}{M#你}持劍時，就像執掌提琴的弓弦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891125,
					"content": "劍…我明白了，這次的主題是「力量」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891126,
					"content": "#來吧，看看{F#妳}{M#你}所帶來的「力量」靈感，最終會凝聚成怎樣的料理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "愛可菲"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891122,
					"content": "原來是物理傳遞靈感…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401891116,
					"content": "我直接想個辦法在這裡住下來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891117
					]
				}
			]
		},
